@startuml 02 - Data Flow Diagram

!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Inter
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ArrowColor #00AE57
skinparam actorBorderColor #0F5132

title "Natsave Bank KPI — Data Flow Diagram\nLevel 1: System Data Flows"

actor "Finance Analyst" as Analyst
actor "Executive / Viewer" as Viewer

rectangle "Browser (Client)" {
    rectangle "Data Entry Form\n(index.html)" as Form
    rectangle "Dashboard View\n(*.html)" as Dashboard
    rectangle "js/api.js" as ApiClient
    rectangle "Vue.js State" as VState
}

rectangle "PHP API Server" {
    rectangle "Router\n(api/index.php)" as Router
    rectangle "Input Validation\n(Validator.php)" as Validate
    rectangle "Authentication\n(Auth.php)" as Auth
    rectangle "[Domain]Repo.php" as Repo
    rectangle "AuditLogger.php" as Audit
    rectangle "Response.php" as Respond
}

rectangle "MySQL Database" {
    database "Domain Fact Tables\n(fp_*, oe_*, qe_, rm_*, comp_*)" as FactDB
    database "reporting_periods\nkpi_dashboards" as RefDB
    database "audit_log" as AuditDB
    database "kpi_trend_snapshots" as TrendDB
    database "Views\n(v_financial_summary etc)" as ViewDB
}

' ─── READ FLOW (Executive viewing dashboard) ───
Viewer --> Dashboard : 1. Opens page
Dashboard --> ApiClient : 2. Calls api.get('/dashboard')
ApiClient --> Router : 3. HTTP GET /api/dashboard?period=FY2024
Router --> Auth : 4. Verify session
Auth --> Router : 5. OK (viewer role)
Router --> Repo : 6. dispatch to DashboardEndpoint → Repos
Repo --> RefDB : 7. Load active period IDs
Repo --> ViewDB : 8. Query v_financial_summary, v_risk_summary
Repo --> TrendDB : 9. Load quarterly trend snapshots
Repo --> Respond : 10. Build JSON response
Respond --> ApiClient : 11. Return JSON payload
ApiClient --> VState : 12. Update Vue reactive state
VState --> Dashboard : 13. Re-render charts & KPI cards

' ─── WRITE FLOW (Analyst entering data) ───
Analyst --> Form : A. Opens data capture panel
Form --> ApiClient : B. Submits form (POST)
ApiClient --> Router : C. HTTP POST /api/financial
Router --> Auth : D. Verify session (ANALYST+ required)
Auth --> Router : E. OK
Router --> Validate : F. Sanitise & validate input fields
Validate --> Router : G. Cleaned data
Router --> Repo : H. Call FinancialRepo.saveRoaRoe(data)
Repo --> FactDB : I. INSERT/UPDATE fp_roa_roe (period_id via subquery)
Repo --> Audit : J. Log change (old vs new JSON)
Audit --> AuditDB : K. INSERT into audit_log
Repo --> Respond : L. Return { success, id }
Respond --> ApiClient : M. 200 OK + confirmation
ApiClient --> VState : N. Reload dashboard data
VState --> Dashboard : O. Updated metrics displayed

note right of Auth
  Roles:
  VIEWER - GET only
  ANALYST - GET + POST own dept
  MANAGER - GET + POST all
  ADMIN - full access
end note

note bottom of FactDB
  Generated columns auto-compute:
  ROA = net_income / total_assets
  NIM = (int_income - int_expense) / earning_assets
  CIR = operating_expenses / operating_income
  NPS = (promoters - detractors) / total * 100
  All calculations in MySQL, not PHP
end note

@enduml
